we have a list of skilled Licensed Captains familiar with our program and boats. \n\nCaptains on our roster charge $50 an hour, plus tips, payable directly to them after the trip.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "Shelter Island", "booking_notes": "**Please Note:** If you booked a Bareboat Charter for 7-12 Guests. There is still a $150 Captain Fee due directly after the trip. The fee is paid directly to the captain by you. Most of our guests, for awesome service, will tip their captain 15%-20% of the total spend (not just the captain's fee). You can pay the captain's fee and tip with Cash, Credit Card, or Venmo*\n\n[View our Current Captain Roster](https://sailsandiego.com/about-us/)\n\n---\t\n**We genuinely care about your overall experience from start to finish so please continue reading about all the information enclosed below:**\n\n**BEFORE ARRIVAL:**\nPlease have every guest sign our touchless sailing waiver prior to your arrival. The waivers are all digital so no need to print anything out. Don't stress if you're having too much difficulty with them, we can always have you sign them when checking in at our office location.\n\n**CHECK-IN:**\nPlease check in at our office 20-30 minutes before the departure time. A physical boarding pass will be required to board your assigned sailboat. Your boarding pass will be provided at our Sail San Diego office, located at 2720 Shelter Island Drive, San Diego, California 92106.\n\nYou will find us on the corner of the first floor across the street from the Brigantine Restaurant and next to Paragon Deli.\n\nAfter receiving your boarding pass, you will be directed to our private marina for boarding. Gates will open 10 minutes prior to the departure time.\n\n**PARKING:**\nSan Diego hosts 32 million visitors annually, making parking especially limited during summer. We recommend arriving at least 30 minutes early to find parking or using Lyft.\n\nIf using Uber, please ensure you enter our address directly. Do not enter \"Sail San Diego,\" as this will direct the driver to our old location from eight years ago, which is about half a mile away.\n\n[CLICK HERE TO VIEW OUR DIRECTIONS PAGE](https://sailsandiego.com/contact/)\n\n**PROHIBITED ITEMS:**\nNO SMOKING, HARD ALCOHOL OR RED WINE.\n\nFeel free to bring outside beverages and snacks, but remember you're on a sailboat. Hand-held foods are recommended.\n\nWe are a federally regulated business and drugs are strictly prohibited (including Marijuana) while underway or at the marina. Vessel will return to the dock and Harbor Police will be called if the Captain sees or smells Marijuana. **NO EXCEPTIONS!**\n\nFrom Your Captains and Crew at Sail San Diego\n\nFair Winds and Following Seas", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "All Inclusive Packages • 3 Hours • Staring at $550", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sailsandiego/items/626368/images/1444068/", "pk": 1444068, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/n0DTIrFbQbCcpZjO5vSg", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/n0DTIrFbQbCcpZjO5vSg", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sailsandiego/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sailsandiego/items/626368/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/n0DTIrFbQbCcpZjO5vSg", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/n0DTIrFbQbCcpZjO5vSg", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sailsandiego/items/626368/images/1444069/", "pk": 1444069, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/vn8iUmRGQuaokoNDbD51", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/vn8iUmRGQuaokoNDbD51", "company": {"cls": "